OL,3,GNEWSASwinney aiming for independence
OL,4,Areferendum by 2031
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Minister John Swinney says he
OL,7,Fwants to hold a second Scottish
OL,8,Findependence referendum by 2031.
OL,10,FThe SNP leader also predicted that Andy
OL,11,FBurnham would be the last prime
OL,12,Fminister of the UK following talks with
OL,13,Fnationalist leaders in Cardiff.
OL,15,FSwinney, Plaid Cymru leader Rhun ap
OL,16,FIorwerth, Sinn Fein president Mary Lou
OL,17,FMcDonald and Sinn Feinn vice-president
OL,18,FMichelle O'Neill have signed a joint
OL,19,Fdeclaration stating that "Westminster's
OL,20,Ftime is coming to an end".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
